Z||000000||Haze_Performance||08-22-2000||04:26 AM||||I was thumbing through a new Summit Racing catalog tonight and I saw this.<P>Intellitronix corp. Digital Gauge Kit.<BR>Part# ITC-TH10003 <P>It's a Create-A-Dash Gauge Kit<P>Includes everything you need to custom design your own digital dashboard. 3 3/8" Speedo & Tach plus 2 1/16" Voltmeter, Oil Pressure, Fuel Level & Water Temp. A smoked acrylic sheet, a special drill bit and jigsaw blade for custom cutting the lenses & all the senders (except for the fuel level gauge) $399.00<P>P.S. These are NOT the round gauges. They are the type that are mounted on a circut board.<P>Theres a pic in the catalog. They look good to me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycarsig.jpg"> My 1985 2M4 Sport Coupe<P><BR>My Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>H.M.P. </A>||||reg||14
